scription_en":"Beijing Shougang LanzaTech Technology Co., Ltd. operates in the carbon capture, utilization and storage industry, also known as CCUS industry. The company mainly focuses on producing low-carbon products including ethanol and microbial protein through carbon capture and utilization technologies and providing low carbon integrated solutions. The company's products are used in automotive fuel, as well as raw materials for the production of perfumes, sports fashion, cleaning agents, packaging materials and other products. Beijing Shougang LanzaTech Technology Co., Ltd. was formerly known as Beijing Shougang LanzaTech New Energy Technology Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Beijing Shougang LanzaTech Technology Co., Ltd. in November 2021. Beijing Shougang LanzaTech Technology Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Shijingshan, China.","description_zh":"北京首鋼朗澤科技股份有限公司在碳捕集、利用與儲存（CCUS）行業營運。該公司主要透過碳捕集與利用技術生產低碳產品，包括乙醇和微生物蛋白，並提供低碳綜合解決方案。該公司的產品應用於汽車燃料，以及香水、運動時尚、清潔劑、包裝材料等產品的原材料。北京首鋼朗澤科技股份有限公司前身為北京首鋼朗澤新能源科技有限公司，並於二零二一年十一月更名為北京首鋼朗澤科技股份有限公司。該公司於二零一一年成立，總部位於中國石景山。","address":"Room 1601-6, 16/F, Building 1","city":"Shijingshan","state":"BJ","zip":"100043","country":"CN","phone":"86 10 5925 8895","full_address":"Room 1601-6, 16/F, Building 1, Shijingshan, BJ, 100043, CN","year_high":54.4,"year_low":11.11,"range_52w":"11.11-54.4","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[],"news":[],"historical_dcf_series":null,"real_5y_prices":[],"dataAvailability":{"currentPrice":null,"hkdRiskFreeRate":"usdTreasuryProxyNotObservedHkdYield","asReportedLeases":"sourceUnavailable","ownership":"Provider coverage has not been verified for HKEX","historicalDcf":"No point-in-time historical valuations are available"},"ratingSources":{"fScore":{"asOfDate":null,"period":null,"basis":null,"evaluatedTests":0,"passedTests":0,"reason":"missingComparableStatements","evidenceH